    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Hanley are delighted to present this attractive three-bedroom bungalow, ideally located at Brookhill, just a short walk from Claremorris town centre.Originally extended and comprehensively renovated in 1999, the property offers comfortable family accommodation on a generous elevated site set back from the public road. A tarmac driveway leads to ample parking at the rear of the property, while decorative iron gates provide secure side access. To the rear, a substantial block-built shed offers excellent storage or workshop space.A particularly attractive feature is the large paddock-style lawn to the rear (approx. 1/3 acre), providing exceptional outdoor space with endless possibilities. Whether you're dreaming of a children's play area, a full-sized football pitch, vegetable garden, polytunnel or simply a generous garden to enjoy, the space offers tremendous flexibility.A footpath provides easy access to Claremorris town centre, where a full range of shops, cafés, schools and everyday amenities are available. Bus and rail services are also within easy reach, while nearby lakes and scenic walking routes offer excellent recreational opportunities.Having been vacant for more than two years, the property may be eligible for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to approval. This presents an excellent opportunity for purchasers wishing to further enhance the property to suit their own requirements.This is an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, families, downsizers or anyone seeking a home with generous outdoor space and significant future potential in a highly convenient location.To see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.4m x 6m\nWith solid timber floor\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.2m x 3.6m\nLarge double room to the front, with carpet floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4m x 3.2m\nDouble room to the front of the house with carpet floor. With ensuite bathroom\n\nEn-Suite - 3m x 0.9m\nFully tiled floor and walls, WC, wash hand basin and shower cubicle with electric shower.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.9m x 2.5m\nRoom to the rear of the house with carpet floor, with ensuite bathroom\n\nEn-Suite - 1m x 2m\nWith carpet floor and tiled walls with WC, wash hand basin and shower cubicle with pumped shower.\n\nBathroom - 2.2m x 4m\nFully tiled floor and walls with WC, wash hand basin and bathtub.\n\nKitchen/Living/Dining Room - 6m x 5.5m\nWith solid timber floor, a feature skylight allowing for lots of natural light, solid timber fitted kitchen, a solid fuel stove with back boiler and a sliding door leading to the rear of the house.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Footpath to town centre</li><li>Tarmac Driveway </li><li>Steel gates to the side</li><li>Large lawn/paddock to the rear</li><li>Parking for multiple cars</li><li>Rear yards gets sun all day long</li><li>Block built garage.</ul>"
